{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t財政司司長陳茂波在香港女總裁峰會發表專題演講時表示，香港具備多項優勢，聯通內地和國際，是國際機構建立多元化團隊，並服務跨市場客戶的理想地方。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:01:17.670664+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T11:34:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T22:38:43.371284+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:58:34.088387+00:00","content_hash":"1e58b9445df8c3ae18d10b231f8217304807960e254e88e01c87ffd40a63a1d4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}